%% State machine: OffloadingEvent (medium-tagged) lifecycle.
%% Green path is M1; Failed/Quarantined branch is the resiliency RFC.
%% See docs/design/rfcs/exclusive-tiered-caching.md
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : prepare_store returns
    Pending --> InFlight : worker.start_transfer
    InFlight --> Completed : torch.Event ready
    Completed --> Reported : take_events drained
    Reported --> [*]

    InFlight --> Failed : timeout / error<br/>(resiliency RFC only)
    Failed --> Quarantined : N consecutive failures<br/>(resiliency RFC only)
    Quarantined --> [*] : medium re-enabled

    note right of Reported : OffloadingEvent.medium tags the<br/>destination (FAST_CPU or SLOW_CPU);<br/>per-medium counters fall out for free.
